[ALERT] Refund failed — gift card restored
======================================================

Gift card:           #<%= @gift_card.id %> (<%= @gift_card.merchant&.store_name %>)
Stripe refund ID:    <%= @refund_id %>
Amount:              <%= @amount_formatted %>
Failure reason:      <%= @failure_reason %>

A refund that had already been debited from the gift card did not go
through (the bank rejected it). The card's balance and status were
restored automatically — but the buyer did NOT receive their money back.
Follow up with the buyer and retry the refund from the admin panel or
Stripe.

Review in Stripe: https://dashboard.stripe.com/payments/<%= @gift_card.payment_intent_id %>
